# x32-bridge's state directory (architecture.md §7): the default
# X32_BASELINE_FILE / installation.yaml location relative to the bridge
# process's cwd. Venue data, never repo content.
apps/x32-bridge/data/

# A venue's own topology (issue #26). The live copy belongs in the bridge's
# state directory (`%ProgramData%\X32RoutingVisualizer\` under the MSI), where
# no upgrade can overwrite it; this path is only the seed a release ships, and
# whatever room you happen to be describing is yours, not the repo's.
# `config/installation.sample.yaml` stays tracked as the starting point.
config/installation.yaml
